sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Student (User)
    participant UI as EventCard / Details Modal
    participant ES as EventService
    participant FB as Firebase Firestore
    participant EB as EventBus (Observer)
    participant Header as Notification Tray / Badge

    Student->>UI: Clicks "RSVP / Reserve Spot"
    UI->>ES: reserveSpot(eventId, userProfile)
    
    activate ES
    ES->>FB: Check existing RSVP for user
    FB-->>ES: No prior reservation found
    
    ES->>FB: Fetch current capacity & registeredCount
    FB-->>ES: Event capacity: 50, registeredCount: 42
    
    Note over ES: Validate capacity (42 < 50)
    
    ES->>FB: Create reservation document (ticketCode: "RUET-EVT-9281")
    FB-->>ES: Reservation confirmed
    
    ES->>FB: Increment registeredCount (+1)
    FB-->>ES: Update committed (registeredCount: 43)
    
    ES->>EB: publish("RSVP_CHANGED", { eventId, delta: +1 })
    deactivate ES
    
    par Update RSVP state
        EB-->>UI: Trigger state re-render (Seat count: 43/50)
        UI-->>Student: Display confirmed ticket & booking reference
    and Notify Global Observers
        EB-->>Header: Update "My Bookings" counter badge
    end
